msgid "???+ note \"A3 device mapping\""
msgstr "???+ note \"A3 设备映射\""

msgid ""
"A3 uses a dual-DIE design. This quick start exposes two Ascend device nodes "
"for one selected device, such as `/dev/davinci0` and `/dev/davinci1`."
msgstr ""
"A3 采用双 DIE 设计。本快速入门为所选设备暴露两个 Ascend 设备节点，例如 `/dev/davinci0` 和 "
"`/dev/davinci1`。"

msgid ""
"Exposing two device nodes does not mean that the quick start automatically "
"uses `tensor_parallel_size=2`. Whether parallelism is enabled depends on the"
" model and deployment method."
msgstr "暴露两个设备节点并不意味着快速入门会自动使用 `tensor_parallel_size=2`。是否启用并行取决于模型和部署方式。"

